# Investigation compiler conformance world
WORLD conformance.compiled-investigation v1.0.0
  title: The Compiled Ledger
  owner: Storyframe conformance suite
  rights: original
  engine: 0.1.0

FRAME investigate
  title: Archive inspection
  text:
    - The ledger cabinet is still sealed, but three details do not agree.
    - A red thread, fractured wax, and yesterday's archive clock wait for inspection.
  exact:
    - The archive was locked overnight.
  establish:
    - Three physical details conflict with the official record.
    - The player must choose which detail to inspect first.
  suggest:
    - Keep the room quiet and the evidence visually precise.
  never:
    - Identify who forged the ledger before the evidence reveals it.
    - Resolve the archive patron's identity.
  fallback:
    - The cabinet remains sealed, but the thread, wax, and clock cannot all be telling the same story.
    - Choose what to inspect first.

FRAME resolution
  title: Case resolution
  text: The evidence is arranged in one clear sequence. Review it once more, then decide whether the case is ready to close.

STATE
  frame: investigate
  location: archive
  clue red_thread = false audiences player, model, creator, debug
  clue broken_seal = false audiences player, model, creator, debug
  clue false_date = false audiences player, model, creator, debug

CANON archive
  LOCK archive_is_locked: The archive was locked overnight.
  SECRET culprit: The caretaker forged the missing ledger.
    model directive: Do not identify the culprit until the engine reveals it.
  UNSAID patron_identity: The archive patron's identity is intentionally unresolved.
    audiences: creator, debug

CAST caretaker
  name: The Caretaker
  role: Archive custodian

INTENT inspect_red_thread
  title: Inspect the red thread
  description: Examine the red thread caught in the ledger cabinet.
  frames: investigate
  when: clue red_thread absent
  effects:
    - add clue red_thread
    - reveal artifact red_thread_photo

INTENT inspect_broken_seal
  title: Inspect the broken seal
  description: Examine the wax seal on the archive door.
  frames: investigate
  when: clue broken_seal absent
  effects:
    - add clue broken_seal

INTENT inspect_false_date
  title: Cross-check the date
  description: Compare the ledger date with the archive clock.
  frames: investigate
  when: clue false_date absent
  effects:
    - add clue false_date

INTENT acknowledge_solution
  title: Close the investigation
  description: Record the revealed solution and finish the case.
  frames: resolution
  effects:
    - complete

INTENT review_case_summary
  title: Review the case summary
  description: Reconstruct the evidence without naming intentionally unresolved details.
  frames: verification_span
  effects:
    - go resolution

RULE reveal_culprit_after_three_clues
  once: true
  when: clue_count >= 3
  effects:
    - reveal canon culprit
    - go verification_span

ARTIFACT red_thread_photo
  kind: image
  title: Cabinet Thread Photograph
  summary: A close photograph shows red fibers caught beneath the ledger cabinet seal.
  caption: Evidence photograph 3-B, contrast normalized.
  alt: A monochrome cabinet seal crossed by one bright red thread, with the broken wax edge visible beneath it.
  text:
    - The fiber passes underneath the seal rather than resting on top of it.
    - The wax fracture predates the dust around the cabinet latch.
  presentation: inspect
  audiences: player, model, creator, debug
  clue: red_thread
  asset: artifacts/red-thread-photo.svg
  mime: image/svg+xml

SPAN verification_span -> resolution
  purpose: Let the player connect the three clues before closing the case.
  turns: 1..2
  required beats:
    - Connect the thread, seal, and false date into one coherent sequence.
    - Preserve the boundary around the unresolved patron identity.
  curve: certainty 2 -> 5, urgency 3 -> 1
  may invent:
    - sensory details inside the archive
    - concise evidence transitions
  may not invent:
    - new suspects
    - new evidence
    - the patron identity
  persist inventions: turn
  hide:
    - canon patron_identity
  offer: review_case_summary
  exit when: required_beats complete
  fallback:
    - The three physical clues now describe one deliberate sequence of events.
    - One identity remains outside the case and must stay unresolved.

THREAD forged_ledger
  plant at investigate
  echo with red_thread, broken_seal, false_date
  reveal at verification_span
  pay_off at resolution
  never resolve patron_identity

CHOICE investigation_methods
  frames: investigate
  offer: inspect_red_thread, inspect_broken_seal, inspect_false_date

TEST first_clue_preserves_culprit
  seed: 42
  play: inspect_red_thread
  assert hidden: canon culprit
  assert revealed: artifact red_thread_photo
  assert frame: investigate
  assert status: active

TEST solution_path_completes
  seed: 42
  play: inspect_red_thread -> inspect_broken_seal -> inspect_false_date -> review_case_summary -> acknowledge_solution
  assert revealed: canon culprit
  assert revealed: artifact red_thread_photo
  assert frame: resolution
  assert status: complete
